cacti-network-monitoring is the external addition in the NMS family (PR 3 of 3). It is the open-source
RRDtool-based SNMP graphing and polling platform skill: LAMP architecture, RRDtool data storage, the poller
(cmd.php vs Spine), distributed polling via remote data collectors, the template + data-query model, CDEF/
GPRINT presentation, Thold threshold alerting, the plugin ecosystem, install + MySQL sizing, the Boost
plugin, and common pitfalls. The DESIGN/paradigm/platform-selection decision lives in
network-monitoring-selection (PR 1), to which this skill routes the design question back.

